    <item>
      <title>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD</title>
      <description>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD&lt;br /&gt; Issued at 10:30 PM 22 August 2026&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Moderate to occasionally heavy rainshowers with lightning and strong winds are expected over #Romblon(Romblon, Ferrol, Odiongan, SanFernando, Alcantara, SantaMaria, SanAgustin and Magdiwang) within the next 1 to 2 hours.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; The above conditions are being experienced in #OrientalMindoro(Bulalacao), #Romblon(SanJose, SantaFe and Looc) which may persist within 1 to 2 hours and may affect nearby areas.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; All are advised to take precautionary measures against the impacts associated with these hazards which include flash floods and landslides.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Keep monitoring for updates.</description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 14:30:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">e719808955ccfd3de06fdae43ad99713ce443ce1</guid>
      <category>Thunderstorm Advisory</category>
      <ns0:seen xmlns:ns0="https://pagasa-feeds.local/ns">Sat, 22 Aug 2026 15:44:23 +0000</ns0:seen>
    </item>
